# Key layout for the rabbit r1's physical controls.
#
# The r1 has a push-to-talk button and a scroll wheel (rotary encoder) in
# addition to the touchscreen. The exact keycodes are TBD until the device
# is probed (`adb shell getevent`). This file is a placeholder; the r1-specific
# mapping will replace it during bring-up.
#
# Standard navigation/select keys used by the scroll wheel:
key 103   DPAD_UP
key 108   DPAD_DOWN
key 105   DPAD_LEFT
key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
key 232   DPAD_CENTER
key 28    ENTER

# Push-to-talk (TBD — likely a custom keycode from the r1 keypad driver):
# key ???  VOICE_ASSIST